# Hiraishin marks: which applications may teleport out of their sandbox.
#
# One mark per line:  <app-id> <realm>
#   desktop - the application may reach the session desktop (wayland
#             socket, session dbus); it still never sees the host.
#   system  - the application may reach the host directly. The full
#             teleport, reserved for administration tools.
#
# Everything not listed here can NEVER escape its sandbox, whatever
# it asks for. The gate itself must also be armed
# (etc/namikaze/sandbox.toml: hiraishin_enabled = true) and the gate
# key must exist (etc/namikaze/hiraishin.key, 0600) - all three must
# agree before a kunai is issued.
